{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>台媒報道，曾被封為「太陽花女神」的劉喬安，涉嫌勾結香港黑幫「14K」將590克可卡因運來台灣，被新北地檢署起訴。檢方近日偵結，認定她涉犯最重可處死刑或無期徒刑的「運輸第一級毒品罪」，依法起訴並求處重刑。</p><figure><img alt=\"劉喬安憑藉美貌在太陽花學運中一炮而紅。（Youtube片段截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/329315/org/3b50c0324c633ed8eabf27bfbd52ad1f.jpg/KWoYHajYdAmV1S37ZvgfD2J35mD-KpZzWYlJLFmJSSw\"/><figcaption>劉喬安憑藉美貌在太陽花學運中一炮而紅。（Youtube片段截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉喬安因涉嫌勾結香港黑幫「14K」將590公克可卡因運來台灣，被新北地檢署起訴。（中時新聞網）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261004/1183366505291583488930821.png/0LTIVfcIO78lrUIKwQ8mT-ooUQhYcQVLhzQ84Yc0POE\"/><figcaption>劉喬安因涉嫌勾結香港黑幫「14K」將590公克可卡因運來台灣，被新北地檢署起訴。（中時新聞網）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（翻攝劉喬安Facebook/Instagram）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/2670952/org/63df04b17d686ab4d19c7243b713792c.jpg/d-nDV7Fn51pMX-lYSN4lz_dsuI1_ih-LKoHW1CqB1tQ\"/><figcaption>（翻攝劉喬安Facebook/Instagram）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（翻攝劉喬安Facebook/Instagram）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/2670955/org/b235df141a8abd84d0b2368afdcebffa.jpg/dfxd-vuT77WymYolIUrBHoRitUxIywCAtRM3JLUTNyQ\"/><figcaption>（翻攝劉喬安Facebook/Instagram）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（翻攝劉喬安Facebook/Instagram）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/2670951/org/3808f0e245477792775228045a91d2d2.jpg/FN4mj97uBfEA3zdqMGIoSGHUX_yLYogcR0iPdEdIj3Q\"/><figcaption>（翻攝劉喬安Facebook/Instagram）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（翻攝劉喬安Facebook/Instagram）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/2670950/org/1a35b553f0ec52d6efc4d7958ce5bfbc.jpg/GAc-uZIGPbyMmwXUfL0hmuXkds3fUbKhflk2pX5ZNqU\"/><figcaption>（翻攝劉喬安Facebook/Instagram）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（翻攝劉喬安Facebook/Instagram）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/2670961/org/b51985bbc581a46b868b79b0c671c09b.jpg/pVFROZzyVLgeVhaivd-MyXDDHOxszXv_0B1rndAda50\"/><figcaption>（翻攝劉喬安Facebook/Instagram）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（翻攝劉喬安Facebook/Instagram）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/2670960/org/3b7ba418eaa15ce91574f8c6e50abeee.jpg/54oGW3-7dGJbWNXr_BJ5Vw0iRB1gMxyDhQMhiYUDIYk\"/><figcaption>（翻攝劉喬安Facebook/Instagram）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（翻攝劉喬安Facebook/Instagram）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/2670954/org/82b2dc48fcd237e9c111aedb53a3957e.jpg/iQFmz7xjvrFkIB-yGzZH4ie28kbgn4SXprrECKa6xAg\"/><figcaption>（翻攝劉喬安Facebook/Instagram）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉喬安此前擔任過DJ。（翻攝劉喬安Facebook/Instagram）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/2670957/org/5f9c51870d5d648af86aaaebf46b8804.jpg/8E8rbX3gAfNwwdEc85JchDbmXrQid7ZxoZe-iqGXvoo\"/><figcaption>劉喬安此前擔任過DJ。（翻攝劉喬安Facebook/Instagram）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（翻攝劉喬安Facebook/Instagram）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/2670953/org/e01daf1568d8b579fcab008c44caa526.jpg/K_jwsCofRWjEZLnQQ034vD1U4rNE4wPhqja0wqo2tMI\"/><figcaption>（翻攝劉喬安Facebook/Instagram）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉喬安此前擔任過DJ。（翻攝劉喬安Facebook/Instagram）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/2670956/org/5499dea2647413a6ab78a54f7bd55576.jpg/btA7wR0QWRaUEMgBIyPuNhX37poasEFWws2fa8LNn2s\"/><figcaption>劉喬安此前擔任過DJ。（翻攝劉喬安Facebook/Instagram）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（翻攝劉喬安Facebook/Instagram）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/2670958/org/e059847a294bcdc53c6cee8a5676700e.jpg/oLdr5IcAn3BMqcVUXu7h81s6M9O68FaDP8NfZT_DX2U\"/><figcaption>（翻攝劉喬安Facebook/Instagram）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（翻攝劉喬安Facebook/Instagram）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/2670959/org/5ba280b1a9aefced101141747a16ba61.png/30DK6quV9HLutBvhHICivIFQ4WQwWxP5Vbzm71W85u8\"/><figcaption>（翻攝劉喬安Facebook/Instagram）</figcaption></figure><p>遭全台5地檢署通緝潛逃美國7年　今年押解返台歸案</p><p>綜合台媒《中時新聞網》、《自由時報》，劉喬安（現名劉依函）過去因為在聲援2014年台灣的太陽花學運時一張美照爆紅，被封為「太陽花女神」，然而其後被揭曾參與援交及賣淫，還被警方查獲持毒品氯胺酮（K仔）。2019年劉喬安潛逃美國，遭到台灣通緝。</p><figure><img alt=\"劉喬安學運後陸續被媒體指懷疑援交，又捲入跨境仲介賣淫事件，官司纏身。（網上圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/497782/org/b98079bb13d6b9134d3ffb537d268f15.jpg/IGo0k_lOytBM0UKtzaLwcWBOFltAWf-ig_rd3YP63d0\"/><figcaption>劉喬安學運後陸續被媒體指懷疑援交，又捲入跨境仲介賣淫事件，官司纏身。（網上圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>去年1月，美國移民及海關執法局（ICE）透露，劉喬安已在美國落網，且落網時一度情緒失控，大小便失禁。今年6月4日，劉喬安由美方押解抵達桃園機場，落地後立即移送地檢署歸案。</p><figure><img alt=\"劉喬安在美國落網。（圖／翻攝自美國移民及海關執法局網站）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250208/964848527534460928164789.png/hU4_GSmKvcTSpzPdmcagUne_amXObLS4QKcR4UCnEeE\"/><figcaption>劉喬安在美國落網。（圖／翻攝自美國移民及海關執法局網站）</figcaption></figure><p>涉旅居期間蠟燭藏毒空運回台</p><p>報道指出，劉喬安旅居期間又陸續涉及毒品案件，她涉嫌勾結有香港黑幫「14K」背景的販毒集團合作，將590克可卡因分別藏入蠟燭、衣物及鐵盤等物品，再藉由國際快遞空運方式運送來台，事後遭台灣檢方發布通緝並請美方協助緝捕。</p><figure><img alt=\"太陽花女神劉喬安涉毒潛逃，於2025年在美國落網，其後遣返台灣。（中時新聞網）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260604/1139154778694094848016598.png/hh0PuGJNWVrIP5y4vr8sO7ylVlYDTn7KR0UPWEdFD1g\"/><figcaption>太陽花女神劉喬安涉毒潛逃，於2025年在美國落網，其後遣返台灣。（中時新聞網）</figcaption></figure><p>涉犯一級毒品重罪恐判死刑或無期</p><p>新北地檢署指出，劉喬安所涉為重大刑案，法定刑為死刑或無期徒刑；先前於6月押解回台後，檢方已向法院聲請羈押禁見獲准，如今全案偵查終結依法提起公訴。</p><figure><img alt=\"劉喬安（Facebook@劉喬安）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/498010/org/60b54d46086cd393c671b270d7c6b6bd.jpg/teEZEfLYMDMn4uzWE0ZWpi0ZPxJYAHHqNBrTJTQa0yU\"/><figcaption>劉喬安（Facebook@劉喬安）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉喬安（Facebook@劉喬安）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/498037/org/09ede01416c02a4ba727528f0dee18b2.jpg/tbOlya3IPVtPcP3VcSWVEH3oc9v8mgfpaVYcX2lWHF8\"/><figcaption>劉喬安（Facebook@劉喬安）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉喬安（Facebook@劉喬安）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/497987/org/b396a8cb9f2c2ffdd7a43e3a25dd7d6a.jpg/aZVJJOGhM1BW4jw4v6UmKbU_JNkROCW-ND7_mjQ-_5o\"/><figcaption>劉喬安（Facebook@劉喬安）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉喬安（Facebook@劉喬安）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/497986/org/b653f4502f07a04930203b9253f05b15.jpg/ejmSWFHaNxklFGIPAv1QYFs-XN2f44BZbaTK9m2kyvY\"/><figcaption>劉喬安（Facebook@劉喬安）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉喬安（Facebook@劉喬安）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/498008/org/3da5a5d2fb936a714c425ee210344048.jpg/HXyfcpoqLSHexzs1NURwoaWAgKP_M6AkIt83PyLfNz8\"/><figcaption>劉喬安（Facebook@劉喬安）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉喬安（Facebook@劉喬安）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/497988/org/9c89f9dd0e1570f9d84c9167aeda59ba.jpg/lhWPos35su1fOZe10TKjtCCqXhQMR-ZA2Vc3nNlXN5w\"/><figcaption>劉喬安（Facebook@劉喬安）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉喬安（Facebook@劉喬安）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/498004/org/9e57663ae7eb142134e05b50aa77f66a.jpg/L7TzeNdsusoRS_AiUIoeiVuoDd_Yl7VFasI66mrCOuo\"/><figcaption>劉喬安（Facebook@劉喬安）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉喬安（Facebook@劉喬安）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/498007/org/3acd845a88ae81df78a39fbacc12d1a7.jpg/jVwULJ7D5L0IVrZaEjKI1xGK7zDPcKA_4d7LIuHeyyI\"/><figcaption>劉喬安（Facebook@劉喬安）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉喬安（Facebook@劉喬安）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/498034/org/85fd00495299e85fce40a0d9252d60ff.jpg/zIs7tIMpyUO2H4m5SiavrL1qGHpl3xxNUt35S1Ld-Us\"/><figcaption>劉喬安（Facebook@劉喬安）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉喬安（Facebook@劉喬安）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/497985/org/cb51806d107f4ca26688e1fa715ba2e6.jpg/c8Vu67AVDugOkQYGAgl_LC22tY17A97VzRUGWs0VBlo\"/><figcaption>劉喬安（Facebook@劉喬安）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉喬安（Facebook@劉喬安）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/497984/org/2978e73f40b9f45fef18104728ae40de.jpg/CqZfxamxlwaXh_NFL8JStO42eClL3Tx-Sjvh9Eo74fQ\"/><figcaption>劉喬安（Facebook@劉喬安）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉喬安（Facebook@劉喬安）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/498003/org/c3ae859fc4786104c201ef9f1c09ff39.jpg/r5w9VgmtmHEBboZywtmmzrAnOZrrQYGlUMzzpFDM86Q\"/><figcaption>劉喬安（Facebook@劉喬安）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉喬安（Facebook@劉喬安）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/498002/org/ff534d1c20fdef1ca0951d9db510326e.jpg/2JlaFg677LGLTyqKll2wt9H0aU-pLe_xBxSFgAcUhYA\"/><figcaption>劉喬安（Facebook@劉喬安）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉喬安（Facebook@劉喬安）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/498011/org/74487e3466e7b2274f692b09bc65e1a8.jpg/Kpe0q1XOCtgk7DsWEpd2fmRqp-b7pR1y-x0NDfsdDQ0\"/><figcaption>劉喬安（Facebook@劉喬安）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉喬安（Facebook@劉喬安）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/498009/org/29e42a8250d53e091906bdad39ce1a64.jpg/MkyWea-kk0f7RPoIal4wKU9cFe8_nv_DPadFCz2nRQs\"/><figcaption>劉喬安（Facebook@劉喬安）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉喬安（Facebook@劉喬安）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/498036/org/6af28e7cd1ad52a4f0a3dfeade893bf5.jpg/_CwErmfi-166Bx6ZBdCnbKVtgE6PQiHemcNUY5nDVGM\"/><figcaption>劉喬安（Facebook@劉喬安）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"劉喬安（Facebook@劉喬安）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/498035/org/19cb40bae130fccc826098fcac355aa9.jpg/-NO1LYDDBgB65SBn-EDMqdaSYWldgkbjzttTk87bU5M\"/><figcaption>劉喬安（Facebook@劉喬安）</figcaption></figure><p>檢察官認為此案涉及數量龐大的毒品，且涉及跨境販毒，依法將劉喬安提起公訴。檢方偵查後認定罪嫌明確，除運輸第一級毒品罪外並依法起訴，建請法院從重量刑，而此罪刑最高可處死刑或無期徒刑。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-04T03:38:30.972096+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1465,"images":34,"source":"HK01 中國","fallback":"none"}}